tifacts on request.\n51\t- Track milestone status and communicate externally controlled timing\n52\t  (historical lab turnaround: six to nine months) into planning.\n53\t- Manage rework loops: if the review board or lab rejects or qualifies part\n54\t  of the evidence, route the required changes back to the owning work and\n55\t  resubmit.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- The evidence package passes security review board sign-off at all defined\n60\t  milestones.\n61\t- The evidence package is accepted by the external accredited certification\n62\t  laboratory for FIPS 140-3 validation.\n63\t- All review board and lab feedback items are resolved or explicitly tracked\n64\t  with owners and due dates.\n65\t- Externally controlled schedule (review-board cadence, lab turnaround) is\n66\t  visible in status reporting and reflected in delivery expectations.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-2 (P0): the evidence package is submitted through the security review\n71\t  board to the external certification lab.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a9719ed011d20632","agent_id":"a51e6c56cfa0c7e4c","session_id":"d93786ac-0085-40fb-b807-b5feb6113de8","uuid":"2213c04c-2805-4865-9d15-b27bb76ac55c","timestamp":"2026-10-08T15:06:46.827Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-84b1feec4fbfe5b2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
